{"id":"b223cf19d0dec0e5","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LCTable.md","title":"LCTable","display":"LCTable","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"LCTable","parameters":["w","r","v","b","s"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"LCTable"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>w</span><span>r</span><span>v</span><span>b</span><span>s</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：直觉主义命题。有序参数：<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>v</code>、<code>b</code>、<code>s</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ LCTable w r v b s)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ LCModel w r v b)\n  (and\n    (forall q (implies (in q s) (exists a (exists x (and (@ Pair a x q) (and (@ FmI a) (in x w)))))))\n    (and\n      (forall n\n        (forall a\n          (forall x\n            (implies\n              (and (@ Nat n) (and (@ PAtom n a) (in x w)))\n              (iff (@ Edge s a x) (exists u (and (@ App v n u) (in x u))))))))\n      (and\n        (forall a\n          (forall c\n            (forall d\n              (forall x\n                (implies\n                  (and (@ FmI a) (and (@ FmI c) (and (@ PImp a c d) (in x w))))\n                  (iff\n                    (@ Edge s d x)\n                    (forall y (implies (in y w) (implies (@ Edge r x y) (implies (@ Edge s a y) (@ Edge s c y)))))))))))\n        (and\n          (forall a\n            (forall c\n              (forall d\n                (forall x\n                  (implies\n                    (and (@ FmI a) (and (@ FmI c) (and (@ PAnd a c d) (in x w))))\n                    (iff (@ Edge s d x) (and (@ Edge s a x) (@ Edge s c x))))))))\n          (and\n            (forall a\n              (forall c\n                (forall d\n                  (forall x\n                    (implies\n                      (and (@ FmI a) (and (@ FmI c) (and (@ POr a c d) (in x w))))\n                      (iff (@ Edge s d x) (or (@ Edge s a x) (@ Edge s c x))))))))\n            (forall a (forall x (implies (and (@ PBot a) (in x w)) (iff (@ Edge s a x) (in x b)))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315c023b0374de7d\" href=\"?note=315c023b0374de7d\" title=\"ZFC_FmI\">FmI</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e9170a8afc11bfb4\" href=\"?note=e9170a8afc11bfb4\" title=\"ZFC_LCModel\">LCModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" href=\"?note=635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" title=\"ZFC_PAnd\">PAnd</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"892530c42a605aab\" href=\"?note=892530c42a605aab\" title=\"ZFC_POr\">POr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ LCTable w r v b s)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_LCModel|LCModel]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAnd|PAnd]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_POr|POr]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_LCModel|LCModel]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAnd|PAnd]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_POr|POr]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmI","status":"resolved","id":"315c023b0374de7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_LCModel|LCModel]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_PAnd|PAnd]]；[[ZFC_PAtom|PAtom]]；[[ZFC_PBot|PBot]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_POr|POr]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_LCModel","status":"resolved","id":"e9170a8afc11bfb4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_LCModel|LCModel]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[Z